  "ALL_TEXT": "154 EXT. CHERLAPALLY JAIL - MAIZE FARM - DAY \nIt is a cloudy day. Overcast. It might rain. The JAIL \nSUPERINTENDENT is walking with two people from a documentary \nfilm crew - a young, in her 20s woman DIRECTOR, a DOP, also a \nwoman in her 20s, and a young male SOUND RECORDIST, a \nrelatively handsome man. \nEveryone is carrying their gear, and are walking by the maize \nfarm. \nJAIL SUPERINTENDENT \n..mana desham lo \nsamardhavanthamaina aadhunika jailu \nvyavastha...Nijam cheppaalante ee \nmadhya gaali chaala taaja gaa \nundhi...nenu kudaa roju vastha pani \nki....ee gaali naa veepu noppini \nupasamanam chesthundhi ani \nanukuntunnaa... \nSOUND RECORDIST \n(to the DIRECTOR) \nNenu vellu koncham ambient sound \nrecord chesi vostha... \nThe DIRECTOR nods her head. The SOUND RECORDIST heads off \ninto the maize and disappears. \nCUT TO:",
